{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-2605","published":"2026-06-05T11:11:32Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:20:03.641507157Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-45409"],"summary":"python-idna security update","details":"A library to support the Internationalised Domain Names in Applications (IDNA) protocol as specified in RFC 5891 http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5891. This version of the protocol is often referred to as “IDNA2008” and can produce different results from the earlier standard from 2003.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nThis is the same issue as CVE-2024-3651, however the original remediation in 2024 was not a complete fix. Payloads such as &quot;\\u0660&quot; * N or &quot;\\u30fb&quot; * N + &quot;\\u6f22&quot; utilize the valid_contexto function prior to length rejection, and for high values of N will take a long time to process.(CVE-2026-45409)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"python-idna","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP1","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/python-idna&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.6-5.oe2403sp1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"noarch":["python-idna-help-3.6-5.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","python3-idna-3.6-5.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm"],"src":["python-idna-3.6-5.oe2403sp1.src.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-2605.json"}},{"package":{"name":"python-idna","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/python-idna&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.6-5.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"noarch":["python-idna-help-3.6-5.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm","python3-idna-3.6-5.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm"],"src":["python-idna-3.6-5.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-2605.json"}},{"package":{"name":"python-idna","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/python-idna&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS